 :rationale
 "q9-wave1-pilot ported purpose-built reference slices. This record covers
  the first port of decisions that were already load-bearing in .clj: the
  unit is the decision core, not the namespace. Parsing, tables, atoms and
  receipts stay on the host; what a grant covers and when a handle stops
  working crossed over."

